# Loop MIDI storage, validation, and undo

Before changing loop event storage, capture/commit, stop-path validation, undo, or SD loop I/O, read:

**[`docs/Guides/LOOP_MIDI_STORAGE_AND_VALIDATION.md`](docs/Guides/LOOP_MIDI_STORAGE_AND_VALIDATION.md)**

Related guides: [`NOTE_WRAPPING_LOGIC.md`](docs/Guides/NOTE_WRAPPING_LOGIC.md) (display only), [`OVERDUB_OVERLAP_RESOLVE_NOTE_EVALUATIONS.md`](docs/Guides/OVERDUB_OVERLAP_RESOLVE_NOTE_EVALUATIONS.md), [`OVERDUB_LEDGER_NOTE_EVALUATIONS.md`](docs/Guides/OVERDUB_LEDGER_NOTE_EVALUATIONS.md), plans [`overdub_undo_baseline_phase1_refinement.md`](docs/Plans/overdub_undo_baseline_phase1_refinement.md) and [`memory_scalability_refactor_enhancement.md`](docs/Plans/memory_scalability_refactor_enhancement.md).

## Non-negotiable constraints

- **Playback / hot paths:** `flattenActiveCapturePasses` / `LoopPasses::materialize` — not full flatten on stop.
- **Stop path:** `finalizeLoopAtStop` + `LoopStopFinalize` (wrap window only). Do **not** call full `validateAndCleanupMidiEvents` on record/overdub stop.
- **Full validate:** deferred via `processDeferredIdleMaintenance` when transport idle, or on SD load — not on stop.
- **Undo snapshots:** push `shareForSnapshot()` ref (O(1)); **`restoreFromSnapshot` always `cloneShared()`** — never shallow-copy chunk IDs into live state.
- **Undo routing:** While NOTE_EDIT active, `handleUndo` is session-gated (**E:** only — no **U:** fallthrough). After exit, **U:** via global stack (**RecordPassAdded** / **OverdubPassAdded** / **NoteEditPassClosed** / …). **ClearSlot** via `handleUndoClearTrack` when applicable.
- **Overdub entry:** `beginOverdubSession` only — closes open **noteEditPass** when editing; no extra capture-pass undo at overdub start.
- **After flat edits:** `invalidateCaches()` so materialized view and note cache stay in sync.
- **SD:** v4 **passes** via `StorageLoopIo`; chunk IDs in-RAM only until format version bump.
- **Hot path:** no `MemoryMonitor` walks or full-loop sort on record/overdub stop.

## Primary files

`LoopEventStore.*`, `LoopEventBuffer.h`, `Loop.h`, `Loop.cpp`, `Track.cpp`, `TrackUndo.cpp`, `Utils/LoopStopFinalize.h`, `StorageManager.cpp`, `main.cpp` (idle maintenance).

